<stack-static>
    <statement><p><p>A straight water pipe <m>{26}</m> m long is buried at a farm near Kisumu. No tree may be planted within <m>{5}</m> m of the pipe.</p><p>Use the <m>\pi</m> key on your calculator and give answers correct to 1 decimal place.</p><p>(a) Find the length of the boundary of the region (the locus of points exactly <m>{5}</m> m from the pipe).</p><div><fillin characters="8" name="ans1"/> m  </div><p>(b) Find the area of the region.</p><div><fillin characters="8" name="ans2"/> <m>\text{m}^2</m>  </div></p></statement>
    <solution><p><p>The locus of points <m>{5}</m> m from a segment of length <m>{26}</m> m is two straight sides of length <m>{26}</m> m, one on each side of the pipe, joined at each end by a semicircle of radius <m>{5}</m> m. The two semicircles together make one circle.</p><p>(a) Length <m>= 2 \times {26} + 2\pi \times {5} = {83.4}</m> m.</p><p>(b) The region is a rectangle <m>{26}</m> m by <m>{10}</m> m and two half-discs of radius <m>{5}</m> m: area <m>= {26} \times {10} + \pi \times {5}^2 = {338.5}</m> <m>\text{m}^2</m>.</p></p></solution>
    <answer><p><m>83.4159265359</m></p></answer>
    <answer><p><m>338.53981634</m></p></answer>
</stack-static>